steps:
Create src/app/api/request/route.ts: POST handler. Parse body: { courseCode:string, year:number, semester:string, level:string, notes:string, email?:string }. Rate-limit by IP using requestRatelimit from redis.ts. Use createAdminClient() to insert into contact_messages: { name:'Paper Request', email: body.email||'request@noreply.invalid', message:`[REQUEST]
Course: ${courseCode}
Year: ${year}
Semester: ${semester}
Level: ${level}
Notes: ${notes}` }. Return { ok:true } or 429 if rate-limited.
